                    Design: I propose to integrate simple                       
                    test-time augmentation (TTA) by                             
                    averaging predictions from the original                     
                    and horizontally flipped images during                      
                    validation and final inference. This                        
                    will make predictions more robust to                        
                    spatial variations and can boost AUROC                      
                    without changing the model                                  
                    architecture. The predict() function                        
                    will also use the same TTA approach for                     
                    test-time predictions. Below is the                         
                    updated implementation:                                     
                    Results: The training script ran                            
