                    Design: I propose integrating Random                        
                    Erasing augmentation into the training                      
                    pipeline to improve model robustness to                     
                    occlusions and noise. We’ll add                             
                    `transforms.RandomErasing(p=0.5,                            
                    scale=(0.02,0.33), ratio=(0.3,3.3))`                        
                    after normalization in the training                         
                    transforms. Everything else, including                      
                    the model, optimizer, scheduler, and                        
                    TTA, remains unchanged so we can                            
                    directly measure the impact of Random                       
                    Erasing on validation AUROC.                                
