                    -------------------------------                             
                    Design: I propose replacing the static                      
                    CosineAnnealingLR scheduler with a                          
                    dynamic OneCycleLR schedule that ramps                      
                    the learning rate up to a higher max                        
                    (e.g. 1e-3) then back down over the                         
                    course of training. This single change                      
                    often yields better convergence and                         
                    generalization with minimal code                            
                    modifications. We compute the total                         
                    training steps and step the scheduler                       
                    after every batch rather than each                          
                    epoch, leaving all other components                         
                    (model, augmentations, TTA, etc.)                           
                    unchanged.                                                  
