                    None                     | None                             
                    | 0.8997     |                                              
                    | DenseNet121 + TTA (horiz flip)                            
                    | DenseNet121       | 224        |                          
                    None                     | 2-crop                           
                    | 0.9204     |                                              
                    | DenseNet121 + MixUp + TTA                                 
                    | DenseNet121       | 224        |                          
                    None                     | 2-crop                           
                    | 0.8935     |                                              
                    | DenseNet121 + CosineAnnealingLR +                         
                    TTA          | DenseNet121       | 224                      
                    | None                     | 2-crop                         
                    | 0.9276     |                                              
                    | DenseNet121 + MixUp +                                     
                    CosineAnnealingLR + TTA  | DenseNet121                      
                    | 224        | None                                         
                    | 2-crop        | 0.9150     |                              
